OL,3,GNEWSABlaze at community centre used in 
OL,4,AOutlaws TV show                        
OL,6,FFirefighters are responding to a blaze 
OL,7,Fwhich broke out at a derelict community
OL,8,Fcentre which featured in the hit BBC   
OL,9,Fcomedy TV series The Outlaws.          
OL,11,FEight fire engines are currently at the
OL,12,Fscene of a fire at Sea Mills Community 
OL,13,FCentre in Bristol which closed in 2019.
OL,15,FAvon Fire and Rescue Service said some 
OL,16,Fnearby properties had been evacuated   
OL,17,Fand no injuries had been reported.     
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
