OL,3,GNEWSABlaze at community centre used in 
OL,4,AOutlaws TV show                        
OL,6,FThe community centre was used in the   
OL,7,Fcrime comedy thriller series The       
OL,8,FOutlaws which was co-created by actor  
OL,9,Fand comedian Stephen Merchant. He also 
OL,10,Fstarred in the Bristol-based programme 
OL,11,Fwhich was shown on BBC One.            
